{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24634","headline":"送王卿使君赴任苏州因思花迎新使感旧游寄题郡中木兰西院一别 · 白居易","name":"送王卿使君赴任苏州因思花迎新使感旧游寄题郡中木兰西院一别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一别苏州十八载，时光人事随年改。\n不论竹马尽成人，亦恐桑田半爲海。\n莺入故宫含意思，花迎新使生光彩。\n爲报江山风月知，至今白使君犹在。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}